{"id": 10098890, "reference": "SR/01460/26", "publication_date": "2026-06-08T15:40:11.246Z", "modification_date": "2026-06-08T15:40:11.248Z", "country": "France", "product_category": "CHEMICAL_PRODUCTS", "product_name": "Tattoo ink", "product_name_specific": "Premium Tattoo Ink", "risk_description": "The product has an excessive concentration of lead (measured value: 2.4 mg/kg). Lead is harmful to human health, accumulates in the body, can cause developmental neurotoxicity (only if exposure to children expected) and may affect breast-fed or unborn children. The product also contains benzyl alcohol, but the presence is not indicated in the list of ingredients. Consumers are not aware of their presence, and may suffer allergic reactions or skin sensitisation. Furthermore, the product contains methylisothiazolinone (MI), which is prohibited in leave-on cosmetic products.  The product has an excessive concentration of copper (measured value up to 250 mg/kg). Copper can cause liver and kidney damage and might affect fertility. The product has an excessive concentration of diethylene glycol (DEG) (measured value: 0.04%). Diethylene glycol can be lethal as it acutely harms kidneys and the nervous system when swallowed or in contact with the skin. ", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the REACH Regulation nor with the Regulation on the classification, labelling and packaging of substances and mixtures (CLP).", "country_of_origin": "United Kingdom", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Flow Colours"], "model_types": ["MAXI GREEN"], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL"], "measures": ["WARNING_CONSUMERS_OF_RISKS", "REMOVAL_FROM_ONLINE_MARKETPLACE", "PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET"], "photos": [{"photo_id": 11008214, "main": true, "embedding": ""}]}